{"version":1,"slug":"Others__Quantitative_Aptitude_-_SSC_Super_Practice_39909_(20Q)","path":"Others/Quantitative Aptitude - SSC Super Practice 39909 (20Q).html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Others","category":"Quantitative Aptitude - SSC Super Practice 39909 (20Q).html","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":20,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 7cos x - sec x = 4&radic;3 . cos x, then find the value of (cos<sup>2</sup> x  -  7).</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 7cos x - sec x = 4&radic;3 . cos x &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (cos<sup>2</sup> x - 7) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">2&radic;3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2&radic;3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&radic;3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&radic;3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">8&radic;3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8&radic;3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4&radic;3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4&radic;3</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>7cos x - sec x = 4&radic;3 . cos x</p><p>=&gt; 7cos<sup>2</sup> x - 1 = 4&radic;3 cos<sup>2</sup> x</p><p>=&gt; (7  -  4&radic;3) cos<sup>2</sup> x = 1</p><p>=&gt; cos<sup>2</sup> x = 1/(7  -  4&radic;3) * (7 + 4&radic;3)/(7 + 4&radic;3)</p><p>=&gt; cos<sup>2</sup> x = 7 + 4&radic;3</p><p>=&gt; (cos<sup>2</sup> x  -  7) = 4&radic;3</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If A is an acute angle and sec A = cosec A, then find the value of 2sin<sup>2</sup>A +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">tan<sup>2</sup>A</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">3</span></div>&nbsp;-  cos<sup>2</sup>A + 1.&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; sec A = cosec A &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 2sin<sup>2</sup>A + <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">tan<sup>2</sup>A</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">3</span></div> - cos<sup>2</sup>A + 1 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">11/6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">11/6</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">12/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">12/5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">13/4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">13/4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">10/3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">10/3</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Since A is an acute angle and secA = cosecA, therefore A = 45&deg;</p><p>Now,</p><p>2sin<sup>2</sup>A + [(tan<sup>2</sup>A)/3]  -  cos<sup>2</sup>A + 1</p><p>= 2sin<sup>2</sup>45&deg; + [(tan<sup>2</sup>45&deg;)/3]  -  cos<sup>2</sup>45&deg; + 1</p><p>= 2 * (1/2) + (1/3)  -  (1/2) + 1</p><p>= 2 + (1/3)  -  (1/2)</p><p>= (12 + 2  -  3)/6 = 11/6</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If sin A +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">sin A</span></div>&nbsp;= 29, then sin<sup>2</sup> A + cosec<sup>2</sup> A is:&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;  sin A +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">sin A</span></div>&nbsp;= 29, &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; sin<sup>2</sup> A + cosec<sup>2</sup> A &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">837</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">837</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">841</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">841</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">839</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">839</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">835</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">835</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>sinA + (1/sinA) = 29</p><p>sinA + cosecA = 29</p><p>Square both sides,</p><p>sin<sup>2</sup>A + cosec<sup>2</sup>A + 2 sinA cosecA = 841</p><p>sin<sup>2</sup>A + cosec<sup>2</sup>A = 841  -  2 = 839</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the value of &#952;. If (&#960;/2 &lt; &#952; &lt; &#960;) and sin &#952; = 1/&radic;2.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (&#960;/2 &lt; &#952; &lt; &#960;) &#2324;&#2352; sin &#952; = 1/&radic;2 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#952; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">45&deg;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">45&deg;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">150&deg;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">150&deg;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">135&deg;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">135&deg;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">120&deg;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">120&deg;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Given that,</p><p>sin&#952; = 1/&radic;2.</p><p>sin&#952; = sin 45</p><p>But given that (&#960;/2 &lt; &#952; &lt; &#960;),</p><p>So, sin&#952; = sin (&#960;  -  45)</p><p>sin&#952; = sin135</p><p>So, the value of &#952; = 135&deg;.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is the value of (sin 300&deg; x sin 240&deg;)  -  (tan 300&deg; x tan 240&deg;)</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>(sin 300<sup>0</sup> x sin 240<sup>0</sup>) - (tan 300<sup>0</sup> x tan 240<sup>0</sup>) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3.75</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3.75</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2.75</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2.75</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>(sin 300&deg; x sin 240&deg;)  -  (tan 300&deg; x tan 240&deg;)</p><p>= (sin (270&deg; +30&deg;) x sin (270&deg; - 30&deg;))- (tan (270&deg; + 30&deg;) x tan (270&deg; -30&deg;))</p><p>= ((-cos 30&deg;) x (-cos 30&deg;)  -  ((-cot 30&deg;) x (cot 30&deg;))</p><p>= cos<sup>2</sup> 30&deg;  -  (-cot<sup>2</sup> 30&deg;)</p><p>= (3/4) + 3 = 3.75</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If sin&theta; = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>8</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>17</span></div> , then find value of tan&theta;.&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; sin&#952; = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>8</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>17</span></div> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; tan&#952; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">15/17</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">15/17</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">8/15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8/15</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">15/8</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">15/8</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">17/15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">17/15</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>sin&#1256; = 8/17</p><p>P = 8, H = 17</p><p>B = &radic; (17<sup>2</sup> - 8<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>B = 15</p><p>tan&#1256; = 8/15</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Simplify the following:</p><p><div>&nbsp;<div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>cosx - <span style='font-size: 19px;'>&radic;</span><span style='text-decoration:overline'>3</span> sinx</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; paddi