em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">4</span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cot A = cosec A/4 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; sec A &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/4</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>cotA = cosecA/4</p><p>cosA/sinA = 1/4sinA</p><p>cosA = &#188;</p><p>secA = 4</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If sec (4x  -  40)&deg; = cosec (5x + 22)&deg;, then find the value of tan5x&deg;.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; sec (4x - 40) = cosec (5x + 22) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; tan5x &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">&radic;3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&radic;3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/&radic;3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/&radic;3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>sec (4x  -  40)&deg; = cosec (5x + 22)&deg;</p><p>sec (4x  -  40) = sec (90  -  5x  -  22)</p><p>4x  -  40 = 90  -  5x  -  22</p><p>9x = 130  -  22</p><p>9x = 108</p><p>x = 12&deg;</p><p>Now,</p><p>tan5x = tan60 = &radic;3</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If A lies in the first quadrant and 7 sin A = 3, then find the value of&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">14 cosec A - 9</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">7 + 10 cosec A</span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2330;&#2340;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2306;&#2358; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; 7 sin A = 3 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2344;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">14 cosec A - 9</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">7 + 10 cosec A</span></div></div></p><p></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">71/91</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">71/91</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">77/89</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">77/89</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">71/93</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">71/93</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">77/89</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">77/89</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Given,</p><p>7sinA = 3</p><p>sinA = 3/7</p><p>Now,</p><p><img width=91 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image015.png\"></p><p><img width=143 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image016.png\"></p><p><img width=80 height=68 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image017.png\"></p><p><img width=68 height=52 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image018.png\"></p><p><img width=67 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image019.png\"></p><p><img width=35 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image020.png\"></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;Evaluate:&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">sec(34 + A)&deg; - cosec(56 - A)&deg;</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">sin 136&deg; cosec 136&deg;</span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2351;&#2375; :&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">sec(34 + A)&deg; - cosec(56 - A)&deg;</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">sin 136&deg; cosec 136&deg;</span></div></div></p><p></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/2</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p><img width=193 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image010.png\"></p><p><img width=229 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image011.png\"></p><p><img width=213 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image012.png\"></p><p><img width=25 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23810/image013.png\"></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1  -  tan<sup>2</sup> (45&deg;  -  B)</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">1 + tan<sup>2</sup> (45&deg;  -  B)</span></div>&nbsp;= 1, then find the value of Sin 2B.&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1  -  tan<sup>2</sup> (45&deg;  -  B)</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">1 + tan<sup>2</sup> (45&deg;  -  B)</span></div> = 1 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; sin 2B &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>[1  -  Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg;  -  B)]/[1 + Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg;  -  B)] = 1</p><p>1  -  Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg; -  B) = 1 + Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg;  -  B)</p><p>2Tan<sup>2</sup>(45&deg;  -  B) = 0</p><p>Tan(45&deg;  -  B) = 0 , Which is possible when (45&deg;  -  B) = 0</p><p>B = 45&deg;</p><p>Now the value of Sin2B = Sin(2 * 45&deg;) = Sin90&deg; = 1</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the value of 3cot<sup>2</sup>60&deg;  -  8sin<sup>2</sup>30&deg; + sec<sup>2</sup>120&deg;.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>3cot<sup>2</sup>60&deg; - 8sin<sup>2</sup>30&deg; + sec<sup>2</sup>120&deg; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>3cot<sup>2</sup>60  -  8sin<sup>2</sup>30 + sec<sup>2</sup>120</p><p>= 3 * (1/&radic;3)<sup>2</sup>  -  8(1/2)<sup>2</sup> + sec<sup>2</sup>(90 + 30)</p><p>= 1  -  2 + (-cosec 30)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= -1 + 4</p><p>= 3</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">13 cos A - 14 Sin A</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">15 Sin A - 12 cos A</span></div>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">2</span></div>&nbsp;, then find the value of tan A&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">13 cos A - 14 Sin A</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">15 Sin A - 12 cos A</span></div>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">2</span></div>&nbsp;&#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; tan A &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">38/43</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">38/43</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">37/31</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">37/31</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">19/43</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">19/43</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">16/31</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">16/31</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p><img width=139 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image001.png\"></p><p><img width=111 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image002.png\"></p><p><img width=177 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image003.png\"></p><p><img width=85 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image004.png\"></p><p><img width=72 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24241/image005.png\"></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If cos A +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">cos A</span></div>&nbsp;= 20, then find the value of cos<sup>2</sup> A + sec<sup>2</sup> A&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cos A +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">cos A</span></div>&nbsp;= 20, then find the value of cos<sup>2</sup> A + sec<sup>2</sup> A&nbsp;</div> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">402</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">402</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">388</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">388</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">408</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">408</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">398</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">398</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>cosA + (1/cosA) = 20</p><p>cosA + secA = 20</p><p>Square both sides,</p><p>cos<sup>2</sup>A + sec<sup>2</sup>A + 2 = 400</p><p>cos<sup>2</sup>A + sec<sup>2</sup>A = 398</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If the value of A + B =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&pi;</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">2</span></div>&nbsp;and sinA =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&radic;3</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">2</span></div>&nbsp;, then find out the value of sin B + cos B.&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A + B = <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&pi;</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">2</span></div> &#2324;&#2352; sinA = <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&radic;3</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">2</span></div> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; sin B + cos B &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">(1 + &radic;3)/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(1 + &radic;3)/2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&radic;2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&radic;2</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>sinA =<img width=24 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20637/image029.png\"> and A + B = <img width=15 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20637/image028.png\"></p><p>A= 60<sup>o</sup></p><p>So, B= 30<sup>o</sup></p><p>Now, sinB + cosB= sin30<sup>o</sup> + cos30<sup>o</sup></p><p>= <img width=49 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20637/image030.png\"></p><p>=(1 + &radic;3)/2</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;In a triangle KLM, &#8736; M = 90&deg;, if cosec K = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>13</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>5</span></div>, then find the value of <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>(1  -  cos K)</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>sin L</span></div>.&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2319;&#2325; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; KLM &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#8736; M = 90&deg; &#2324;&#2352; cosec K =<div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>13</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>5</span></div> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>(1  -  cos K)</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>sin L</span></div> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1/13</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/13</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">12/13</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">12/13</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">25/12</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">25/12</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/12</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/12</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>Cosec K = 13/5 = hypotenuse/perpendicular = KL/LM</p><p>By Pythagoras theorem,</p><p>Base = &radic; (169  -  25) = &radic;144 = 12 = KM</p><p>Now,</p><p>Cos K = base/hypotenuse = KM/KL = 12/13</p><p>Sin L = KM/KL = 12/13</p><p>Therefore,</p><p>[1  -  (12/13)]/ (12/13) = 1/12.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If Sin A =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">8</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">17</span></div>&nbsp;, then what is the value of Cot A + Sec A?&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; Sin A =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">8</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">17</span></div>&nbsp;, Cot A + Sec A &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; ?</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">2<sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>120</sub></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2<sup>1</sup>&#8260;<sub>120</sub></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3<sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>120</sub></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3<sup>1</sup>&#8260;<sub>120</sub></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4<sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>120</sub></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4<sup>1</sup>&#8260;<sub>120</sub></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5<sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>120</sub></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5<sup>1</sup>&#8260;<sub>120</sub></span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Sin A = 8/17</p><p>Cos A = &radic;(17<sup>2</sup>  -  8<sup>2</sup>)/17 = 15/17</p><p>Cot A = Cos A/Sin A = (15/17)/(8/17) = 15/8</p><p>Sec A = 1/Cos A = 1/(15/17) = 17/15</p><p>Now,</p><p>Cot A + Sec A</p><p>= 15/8 + 17/15</p><p>= (225 + 136)/120</p><p>= 361/120</p><p>= 3(1/120)</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If secA + tanA = 10, then find the value of secA.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; secA + tanA = 10 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; secA &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">101/20</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">101/20</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">91/10</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">91/10</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">101/10</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">101/10</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">91/20</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">91/20</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>secA + tanA = 10...(1)</p><p>We know that,</p><p>secA - tanA = 1/10...(2)</p><p>Adding equation (1) and (2),</p><p>2secA = 10 + (1/10)</p><p>2secA = 101/10</p><p>secA = 101/20</p><p></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If cot A = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>3</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>7</span></div> , then find the value of <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>cosec<sup>2</sup>A</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>sec<sup>2</sup>A</span></div> .&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cot A = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>3</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>7</span></div> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>cosec<sup>2</sup>A</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>sec<sup>2</sup>A</span></div> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">16/49</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">16/49</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">9/49</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9/49</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">9/16</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9/16</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">16/9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">16/9</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>cosec<sup>2</sup>A/sec<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>= cos<sup>2</sup>A/sin<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>= cot<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>= (3/7)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 9/49</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}